IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-GROUP.
   05 WS-A PIC 9(3) VALUE 123.
   05 WS-B PIC X(5) VALUE "HELLO".
